Such situations include -  divorce with sole custody and mere visitation;  divorce with joint custody and visitation;  divorce with sole custody and no visitation;  divorce with complete disowning of the child;  divorce with some rights being given to the child;  divorce between the couple but rights vesting in either side's grandparents;
 Separation with divorce pending and visitation issues pending in Court;
 Desertion by either parent;
 Divorce or Separation with conditions relating to subsequent marriages which may alter the relationship with the child;  Legal disowning of the child by either parent;
2023:DHC:2784  Situations where the couple are in different countries and an attempt is made to remove the child from a jurisdiction;
